This contract is a NEAR port of Privacy Pools v1 core (github.com/0xbow-io/privacy-pools-core, tag v1.3.0),
Copyright 2025 0XBOW LTD, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. Its state layout, constants and, in later
parts, its deposit, withdrawal and ragequit logic follow Privacy Pools' contracts (State.sol, PrivacyPool.sol,
Entrypoint.sol); each ported file names its source. Privacy Pools ships no NOTICE file at that tag. The changes from
Privacy Pools are listed in the vault's design: no Entrypoint and no admin, no ASP postman (the vault approves every
deposit's label itself), NEAR storage, and the relayer fee as an absolute amount.

The vault's two trees follow the layout of zk-kit's LeanIMT (Privacy & Scaling Explorations, Ethereum Foundation;
MIT License): today only that layout (size, depth, side nodes), no zk-kit code. When its code is ported, zk-kit's MIT
licence text ships here with it.

src/poseidon.rs holds the round constants and MDS matrices for widths 3 and 4 copied from light-poseidon 0.4.1
(github.com/Lightprotocol/light-poseidon, src/parameters/bn254_x5.rs; Light Protocol), licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0, and the vault calls light-poseidon's Poseidon as a dependency. light-poseidon ships no
NOTICE file (its 0.4.1 crate holds none).
